\section{Adaptive Constraint Structure}

Each system carries a dynamic constraint field:

\[
\mathcal{C}_t(X) = (\mathcal{R}, \mathcal{I}, \mathcal{S})
\]

where:
\begin{itemize}
  \item $\mathcal{R}$ = resources
  \item $\mathcal{I}$ = graded invariants
  \item $\mathcal{S}$ = structural entropy
\end{itemize}

Evolution:

\[
\mathcal{C}_{t+1} = \mathcal{F}(\mathcal{C}_t, X_t)
\]

